@ ---------------------------------------------------------------- text
HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_0:
	.string "!!! No way! You're {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "The champion from JOHTO!\p"
	.string "Could you sign my hat? Please?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_1:
	.string "Excuse me! You're {PLAYER}, right?\n"
	.string "I saw you on JOHTO TV!\p"
	.string "Would you sign my notebook?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_2:
	.string "It's really you! {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I have to get your autograph!\n"
	.string "Here, sign my towel!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_After:
	.string "I'm going to frame your autograph!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_Signed:
	.string "{PLAYER} signed it with a flourish.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_autograph_Thanks:
	.string "I'm never washing this again!\n"
	.string "Wait till everyone hears about this!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_cheer_0:
	.string "I was going to challenge you…\p"
	.string "But I heard what you did in JOHTO\n"
	.string "and KANTO. I'll train some more first.\p"
	.string "Good luck with the HOENN GYMS!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_cheer_1:
	.string "Wait, aren't you…? Wow.\n"
	.string "I'm nowhere near ready for you.\p"
	.string "But I'm rooting for you!\n"
	.string "Go show HOENN what you've got!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_cheer_After:
	.string "HOENN's GYM LEADERS are tougher\n"
	.string "than they look. Hang in there!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_follower_0:
	.string "Hey, you! Let's battle right-\p"
	.string "…Is that your {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
	.string "It's staring right at me…\p"
	.string "Y-you know what? Never mind!\n"
	.string "I just remembered I'm busy!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_follower_1:
	.string "Hey! You look like an easy-\p"
	.string "…Whoa. {STR_VAR_1} looks like it's\n"
	.string "been through a hundred battles.\p"
	.string "I'll… find someone else. Bye!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_follower_2:
	.string "A TRAINER! Battle me, battle-\p"
	.string "…Your {STR_VAR_2} just yawned at me.\n"
	.string "That's never a good sign.\p"
	.string "Let's just say you won, OK?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_follower_After:
	.string "I'm going to stand over here and\n"
	.string "not make eye contact. Thanks.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_follower_None:
	.string "Hey! Let's batt-\p"
	.string "Wait. Those BADGES on your TRAINER\n"
	.string "CARD… You're the JOHTO champion!\p"
	.string "Forget I said anything!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_foresee_0:
	.string "I foresaw this meeting…\p"
	.string "I also foresaw how our battle ends.\n"
	.string "Let's skip it, shall we?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_foresee_1:
	.string "Your future flickered into my mind\n"
	.string "before you arrived.\p"
	.string "In it, I lost. Badly.\n"
	.string "I'll pass, thank you.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_foresee_After:
	.string "My visions are never wrong.\n"
	.string "Well… rarely.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_song_0:
	.string "Yo! You're {PLAYER}, the JOHTO\n"
	.string "champion? I'm writing a song about\l"
	.string "you! Here's the first verse!\p"
	.string "“From far away, a TRAINER came…\n"
	.string "Sixteen BADGES and a famous name!”\p"
	.string "Catchy, right? I'm sending it to the\n"
	.string "TV station!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Fake_song_After:
	.string "Keep your eyes on HOENN TV!\n"
	.string "The song's gonna be huge!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_JaggedPass_Text_EthanRegister:
	.string "When I get more used to this bumpiness,\n"
	.string "I'll be sure to win!\p"
	.string "Can you register me in your POKéGEAR?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_MeteorFalls_1F_2R_Text_NicolasRegister:
	.string "I want to know more about your power.\n"
	.string "Let me register you in my POKéGEAR.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_MtChimney_Text_SawyerRegister:
	.string "I like little fireballs like you.\n"
	.string "Let me register you in my POKéGEAR.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieRegister:
	.string "Fufufu… I lost the match, but…\n"
	.string "I have this little ability…\p"
	.string "Without ever laying my hands on\n"
	.string "your POKéGEAR… Hiyah!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route102_Text_CalvinRegisterShort:
	.string "I'd like to battle you again, so can\n"
	.string "you register me in your POKéGEAR?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route104_Text_HaleyRegister2:
	.string "You're strong, but should I register\n"
	.string "you in my POKéGEAR?\l"
	.string "Maybe I shouldn't…\p"
	.string "Okay, sure, I will register you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route112_Text_TrentRegister:
	.string "Ow, my legs have cramped up.\n"
	.string "Can you grab me some bandages from\l"
	.string "my backpack?\p"
	.string "No, that's my POKéGEAR!\n"
	.string "Oh, fine, I'll register you.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route113_Text_LaoRegister:
	.string "Yiiyaah! Witness the ancient ninja\n"
	.string "technique of POKéGEAR registration!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route113_Text_MadelineRegister:
	.string "Here, slide under my parasol.\n"
	.string "Let me register you in my POKéGEAR.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route116_Text_KarenRegister2:
	.string "Oh, wow! Isn't that a POKéGEAR?\n"
	.string "I have one, too! Please register me!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route118_Text_RoseRegister:
	.string "Sniff… That odor--it's a POKéGEAR!\n"
	.string "We must register each other!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route119_Text_CatherineRegister:
	.string "Do you have a POKéGEAR?\n"
	.string "It's a must-have tool for any TRAINER.\p"
	.string "Oh, you do have one!\n"
	.string "Let's register each other, then!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route120_Text_RobertRegister:
	.string "You can be counted on to get better.\n"
	.string "I'd like to register you in my POKéGEAR!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route121_Text_CristinRegister:
	.string "That was total humiliation!\n"
	.string "I won't forget you…\l"
	.string "Hand over your POKéGEAR!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Gear_Route128_Text_IsaiahRegister:
	.string "I know I'm not good now, but I think\n"
	.string "I can win eventually.\p"
	.string "Please register me in your POKéGEAR.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_0:
	.string "I know who you are. The champion\n"
	.string "from JOHTO.\p"
	.string "I'll probably lose. But I'd never\n"
	.string "forgive myself if I didn't try!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_1:
	.string "They say you beat RED himself.\n"
	.string "I don't care! Battle me anyway!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_2:
	.string "I've trained for a day like this.\n"
	.string "Even if I lose, I'll learn something!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_3:
	.string "Everyone told me not to challenge\n"
	.string "you. That only makes me want to more!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_4:
	.string "Win or lose, I want to feel a\n"
	.string "champion's strength up close!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_5:
	.string "My POKéMON are shaking…\n"
	.string "But they want this as much as I do!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_double_0:
	.string "We know we're outmatched.\n"
	.string "But two of us beat as one!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_hopeful_double_1:
	.string "Together we might stand a chance…\n"
	.string "Maybe! Let's go!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_0:
	.string "A champion from JOHTO, out here?\n"
	.string "I've been waiting for a real test.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_1:
	.string "Finally, someone worth battling.\n"
	.string "Don't hold back on my account.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_2:
	.string "Nobody on this route can beat me.\n"
	.string "Let's see if you can.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_3:
	.string "Your name reached HOENN long before\n"
	.string "you did. Show me it's earned!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_4:
	.string "Strong TRAINERS seek out stronger\n"
	.string "ones. That's why I'm here.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Intro_strong_double_0:
	.string "Two of us against one champion.\n"
	.string "That sounds about fair!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_bird_0:
	.string "Bird POKéMON ride the sea breeze\n"
	.string "here. Look up, you'll see them!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_bird_1:
	.string "I'm just watching the sky today.\n"
	.string "It's a good day for flying.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_breed_0:
	.string "Raising POKéMON takes love and\n"
	.string "patience. Yours look well cared for.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_bug_0:
	.string "I'm looking for rare BUG POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Watch where you step!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_camp_0:
	.string "We're camping out here all week!\n"
	.string "The stars at night are amazing.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_camp_1:
	.string "I packed way too many sandwiches.\n"
	.string "Want one? No? More for me!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_fish_0:
	.string "Shh! You'll scare off the big one!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_fish_1:
	.string "The fish bite best when you're\n"
	.string "patient. Patience is everything.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_kid_0:
	.string "I'm gonna be a GYM LEADER someday!\n"
	.string "Just you wait!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_kid_1:
	.string "My mom says I can't battle until\n"
	.string "I finish my homework. Ugh.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_mind_0:
	.string "The spirits are quiet today.\n"
	.string "That's… unusual.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_mind_1:
	.string "I sense a powerful aura around you.\n"
	.string "I'd rather not test it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_music_0:
	.string "I'm working on a new song.\n"
	.string "Need some peace and quiet for it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_posh_0:
	.string "I'm simply here to enjoy the scenery.\n"
	.string "Battling would ruin my outfit.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_posh_1:
	.string "Such a lovely day for a stroll.\n"
	.string "Don't you agree?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_rock_0:
	.string "These mountains were here long before\n"
	.string "any of us. Respect them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_rock_1:
	.string "I'm sure there are ruins hidden\n"
	.string "somewhere in HOENN. I'll keep digging!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_sea_0:
	.string "Ahoy! I've sailed these waters for\n"
	.string "years. HOENN's sea is like no other.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_swim_0:
	.string "HOENN's warm currents are the best\n"
	.string "training there is. For me, anyway.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_swim_1:
	.string "I swam all the way out here.\n"
	.string "Battling can wait. I need a breather.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_swim_2:
	.string "The sea's been so calm these past\n"
	.string "few years. Nothing like the old days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_tri_0:
	.string "Run, bike, swim, repeat!\n"
	.string "I'm training for the HOENN triathlon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Npc_tri_1:
	.string "My legs are burning!\n"
	.string "No battles today, sorry.$"
